{"id": "3293709", "name": "פולינום טיילור מסדר שני וקירוב ערך", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: auto; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;\">פולינום טיילור מסדר שני וקירוב ערך</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">נתונה הפונקציה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 18px;\">[[if test=\"{{CT:12}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)=\\sin\\left({{CT:0}}x+{{CT:1}}y\\right)\\) [[elif test=\"{{CT:13}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)=x^{{CT:2}}y^{{CT:3}}\\) [[elif test=\"{{CT:14}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)=\\ln x+{{CT:4}}\\ln y\\) [[else]] \\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)=e^{{{CT:4}}x+{{CT:5}}y}\\) [[/if]]</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0 0 0;\">נפתח סביב הנקודה \\(a={{CT:6}}\\).</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 9px;\">א. פולינום טיילור</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0;\">מצאו את פולינום טיילור מסדר \\(2\\) של \\(f\\) סביב \\(a\\). נסמן אותו ב־\\(P_2(x,y)\\).</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_2(x,y)=\\) [[input:ans1]]\n<div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 9px;\">ב. קירוב בעזרת פולינום טיילור</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">תהי \\(b={{CT:7}}\\). השתמשו ב־\\(P_2\\) כדי לקרב את \\(f(b)\\).</p>\n[[if test=\"{{CT:12}}\"]]\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0;\">כלומר, קרבו את \\(\\displaystyle \\cos\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)\\).</p>\n[[elif test=\"{{CT:13}}\"]]\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0;\">כלומר, קרבו את \\(\\displaystyle \\left({{CT:9}}\\right)^{{CT:2}}\\left({{CT:10}}\\right)^{{CT:3}}\\).</p>\n[[elif test=\"{{CT:14}}\"]]\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0;\">כלומר, קרבו את \\(\\displaystyle \\ln\\left({{CT:9}}\\right)+{{CT:4}}\\ln\\left({{CT:10}}\\right)\\).</p>\n[[else]]\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0;\">כלומר, קרבו את \\(\\displaystyle e^{{{CT:11}}}\\).</p>\n[[/if]]\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f(b)\\approx\\) [[input:ans2]]\n<div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.7; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">עבור \\(a=(a_1,a_2)\\), פולינום טיילור מסדר שני הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 9px; margin: 7px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_2(x,y)=f(a)+f'_x(a)(x-a_1)+f'_y(a)(y-a_2) +\\frac{f''_{xx}(a)}{2}(x-a_1)^2 +f''_{xy}(a)(x-a_1)(y-a_2) +\\frac{f''_{yy}(a)}{2}(y-a_2)^2 \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">בנקודה הנתונה מתקבלים \\(f(a)={{CT:15}}\\), \\(f'_x(a)={{CT:16}}\\), \\(f'_y(a)={{CT:17}}\\), \\(f''_{xx}(a)={{CT:18}}\\), \\(f''_{xy}(a)={{CT:19}}\\), \\(f''_{yy}(a)={{CT:20}}\\).</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 9px; margin: 7px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_2(x,y)={{CT:21}}\\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לקירוב בנקודה \\(b={{CT:7}}\\) מציבים את \\(b\\) בפולינום:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f(b)\\approx P_2(b)={{CT:22}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pP2]] [[feedback:papprox]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 46, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "papprox", "value": 0.35, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "papprox-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> הקירוב בעזרת \\(P_2\\) חושב נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "papprox-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הציבו את הנקודה \\(b\\) בתוך פולינום טיילור שמצאתם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pP2", "value": 0.65, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pP2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> פולינום טיילור מסדר שני חושב נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pP2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">בדקו את ערכי הנגזרות בנקודת הפיתוח ואת המקדמים \\(1/2\\) של האיברים הטהורים מסדר שני.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["P2", "a1", "a2", "approx", "atuple", "b1", "b2", "bestlength", "btuple", "c", "case1", "case2", "case3", "d", "dx", "dy", "explin", "f0", "fam", "fexpr", "fx0", "fxexpr", "fxx0", "fxxexpr", "fxy0", "fxyexpr", "fy0", "fyexpr", "fyy0", "fyyexpr", "k", "l", "m", "mn", "n", "tans1", "tans2", "trigdelta", "trylength"], "nvariants": 50}